            {
                "@id": "http://www.w3id.org/hsu-aut/VDI3682#hasInput",
                "@type": [
                    "http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#ObjectProperty"
                ],
                "http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#subPropertyOf": [
                    {
                        "@id": "http://www.w3id.org/hsu-aut/VDI3682#flow"
                    }
                ],
                "http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#domain": [
                    {
                        "@id": "_:genid-a980084a203a495f9048ababc1c700d721566-b19"
                    }
                ],
                "http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#range": [
                    {
                        "@id": "http://www.w3id.org/hsu-aut/VDI3682#State"
                    }
                ],
                "http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment": [
                    {
                        "@value": "ObjectProperty that is used to link a ProcessOperator with an Input, i.e. Energy or Information or Product."
                    }
                ]
            },
            {
                "@id": "http://www.w3id.org/hsu-aut/VDI3682#hasOutput",
                "@type": [
                    "http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#ObjectProperty"
                ],
                "http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#subPropertyOf": [
                    {
                        "@id": "http://www.w3id.org/hsu-aut/VDI3682#flow"
                    }
                ],
                "http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#domain": [
                    {
                        "@id": "_:genid-a980084a203a495f9048ababc1c700d721566-b20"
                    }
                ],
                "http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#range": [
                    {
                        "@id": "http://www.w3id.org/hsu-aut/VDI3682#State"
                    }
                ],
                "http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment": [
                    {
                        "@value": "ObjectProperty that is used to link a ProcessOperator with an Output, i.e. Energy or Information or Product."
                    }
                ]
            },
            {
                "@id": "http://www.w3id.org/hsu-aut/VDI3682#Process",
                "@type": [
                    "http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class"
                ],
                "http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment": [
                    {
                        "@value": "A process describes the desired function of a process operator, by means of a solution neutral description of inputs and outputs. Products,energies  and information are converted into new products,energies  and information by a process operator. The process operator implements this conversion with the help of technical resources.\n[VDI3682-1]\n\nNote that a process may have inputs and outputs. These are inputs / outputs that are on the system limit of this process."
                    },
                    {
                        "@value": "A process describes the desired behavior of a process operator, by means of a solution neutral description of inputs and outputs. Products,energies  and information are converted into new products,energies  and information by a process operator. The process operator implements this conversion with the help of technical resources.\n[VDI3682-1]\n\nNote that a process may have inputs and outputs. These are inputs / outputs that are on the system limit of this process."
                    }
                ],
                "http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#disjointWith": [
                    {
                        "@id": "http://www.w3id.org/hsu-aut/VDI3682#TechnicalResource"
                    },
                    {
                        "@id": "http://www.w3id.org/hsu-aut/VDI3682#State"
                    },
                    {
                        "@id": "http://www.w3id.org/hsu-aut/VDI3682#SystemLimit"
                    }
                ]
            },
            {
                "@id": "http://www.w3id.org/hsu-aut/VDI3682#consistsOf",
                "@type": [
                    "http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#ObjectProperty"
                ],
                "http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#subPropertyOf": [
                    {
                        "@id": "http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#topObjectProperty"
                    }
                ],
                "http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#domain": [
                    {
                        "@id": "http://www.w3id.org/hsu-aut/VDI3682#Process"
                    }
                ],
                "http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#range": [
                    {
                        "@id": "_:genid-a980084a203a495f9048ababc1c700d721566-b52"
                    }
                ],
                "http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment": [
                    {
                        "@language": "en",
                        "@value": "Describes containment of process elements (state, process operator, system limit) within a process"
                    }
                ]
            },
            {
                "@id": "http://www.hsu-ifa.de/ontologies/DINEN61360#has_Instance_Description",
                "@type": [
                    "http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#ObjectProperty",
                    "http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#InverseFunctionalProperty"
                ],
                "http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#domain": [
                    {
                        "@id": "_:genid-a980084a203a495f9048ababc1c700d721566-b53"
                    }
                ],
                "http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#range": [
                    {
                        "@id": "http://www.hsu-ifa.de/ontologies/DINEN61360#Instance_Description"
                    }
                ],
                "http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#inverseOf": [
                    {
                        "@id": "http://www.hsu-ifa.de/ontologies/DINEN61360#is_Instance_Description_of_Data_Element"
                    }
                ],
                "http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment": [
                    {
                        "@value": "Description:\nObjectProperty is used to connect an individual that needs to be described by DataProperties with the Instance Description of that properties."
                    }
                ]
            },
            {
                "@id": "http://www.w3id.org/hsu-aut/VDI2206#BasicSystem",
                "@type": [
                    "http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class"
                ],
                "http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#equivalentClass": [
                    {
                        "@id": "http://www.w3id.org/hsu-aut/VDI3682#TechnicalResource"
                    }
                ],
                "http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment": [
                    {
                        "@value": "The basic system is generally a mechanical, electromechanical, hydraulic or pneumatic structure or a combination of these."
                    }
                ],
                "http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label": [
                    {
                        "@value": "Basic System"
                    }
                ]
            },
            {
                "@id": "http://www.w3id.org/hsu-aut/VDI2206#Component",
                "@type": [
                    "http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class"
                ],
                "http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#subClassOf": [
                    {
                        "@id": "http://www.w3id.org/hsu-aut/VDI2206#BasicSystem"
                    }
                ],
                "http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment": [
                    {
                        "@value": "A component is defined as the smallest functional unit of a module,each dedicated to exactly one function (sensing, actuating, information processing, or providing structural support) and interacting with other components and higher-level modules through defined interfaces"
                    }
                ],
                "http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label": [
                    {
                        "@value": "Component"
                    }
                ]
            },
            {
                "@id": "http://www.w3id.org/hsu-aut/VDI3682#ProcessOperator",
                "@type": [
                    "http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class"
                ],
                "http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#subClassOf": [
                    {
                        "@id": "_:genid-a980084a203a495f9048ababc1c700d721566-b13"
                    },
                    {
                        "@id": "_:genid-a980084a203a495f9048ababc1c700d721566-b14"
                    },
                    {
                        "@id": "_:genid-a980084a203a495f9048ababc1c700d721566-b15"
                    }
                ],
                "http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#equivalentClass": [
                    {
                        "@id": "_:genid-a980084a203a495f9048ababc1c700d721566-b16"
                    },
                    {
                        "@id": "_:genid-a980084a203a495f9048ababc1c700d721566-b17"
                    },
                    {
                        "@id": "_:genid-a980084a203a495f9048ababc1c700d721566-b18"
                    }
                ],
                "http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment": [
                    {
                        "@value": "One step of a process that transfers a status \"before\" (i.e., an input) to a status \"after\" (i.e., an output). \nEverything that has an input and an output may be a process operator (but could also be a process).\nEverything that has an input and an output AND is contained within a process is a process operator."
                    }
                ],
                "http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#disjointWith": [
                    {
                        "@id": "http://www.w3id.org/hsu-aut/VDI3682#TechnicalResource"
                    },
                    {
                        "@id": "http://www.w3id.org/hsu-aut/VDI3682#State"
                    },
                    {
                        "@id": "http://www.w3id.org/hsu-aut/VDI3682#SystemLimit"
                    }
                ]
            },
            {
                "@id": "http://www.hsu-ifa.de/ontologies/DINEN61360#has_Type_Description",
